event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":93,"item_id":"rs_06787185e4135c9d016ac92de05ea8819586fbea21fbbddaed","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Implementing server-side rendering**\n\nI'm considering how to implement server-side rendering (SSR) forms that are easy to access without any client-side browser requirement. I need to think about POST redirects and how to handle validation errors by rendering alerts for 400 responses. I'll also create a default database structure with SQLite and set up tests using Node to check the persistence and health of validations. It all needs to work cohesively, including the CSS for layout and the routing for projects and details."}

